#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the Diffie Hellman group for PFS.\n"
#| "The following assignment will is used:\n"
#| "server = DH group is recieved from server (cisco only)\n"
#| "nopfs = no pfs is used\n"
#| "dh1 = modp768\n"
#| "dh2 = modp1024\n"
#| "dh5 = modp1536\n"
#| "d14 = modp2048 (racoon only)\n"
